  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TRADEMARK AFRICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Women in Agri-Food for Resillience and Empowerment (AWARE) Programme in Uasin Gishu and Trans Nzoia counties in Kenya aims to strengthen 30 women-led small agri-food enterprises through combined practical training in business development, marketing, financial management, climate-smart agriculture, food safety, and export readiness with personalised, on-site business coaching to help enterprises improve operations and expand their markets. It will also create opportunities for SMEs to connect with buyers, access digital trading platforms, and contribute to county-level food system dialogues.</narrative>
  </description>
